                , a free open-source hiking route planner for the UK and
                Ireland.
            </p>

            <p>
                I'm passionate about solving problems that affect me and the
                people around me, whether that's making hiking more accessible
                or building things I find both interesting and useful.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
